{"seq":2,"slug":"quote-confidence-adjust","title":"估价置信度与到检调整","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-in-exchange-program/used-tradein-valuation/quote-confidence-adjust","wordCount":2190,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"估价置信度与到检调整\">估价置信度与到检调整</h1><p>上一篇给出的估价模型输出的是一个点值，但那个点值建立在一个不可靠的输入上：用户自述的成色。用户说「屏幕无划痕」，验机台可能看到一道细纹；用户说「电池正常」，读出来是 78%。如果系统只输出点值，那么每一次到检差异都是一次意外，而意外只能靠客服特批来消化——这是换新业务最常见的运营黑洞。正确的设计是让报价自己承认不确定性：既给出区间，也给出一个用户看得懂的「可能会调到多少」的规则。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-不确定性从哪来\">核心概念：不确定性从哪来</h2><p>估价的误差源可以分成四类，它们的处理方式完全不同，混在一起讨论会得出错误的结论。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>误差源</th>\n<th>性质</th>\n<th>能否靠数据消除</th>\n<th>处理方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>成色自述偏差</td>\n<td>系统性 + 随机</td>\n<td>部分（可校准偏置）</td>\n<td>宽区间 + 到检规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基准价滞后</td>\n<td>系统性</td>\n<td>否（只能缩短周期）</td>\n<td>显式时效标注</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>验机台判定差异</td>\n<td>系统性（机构间）</td>\n<td>部分（可标定）</td>\n<td>验机标准 + 复核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>真实随机（运输损伤）</td>\n<td>随机</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>由保险/兜底承担</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第一类和第三类是可以被建模的，第二类只能被时间戳标记，第四类必须被转移出去——它不该由估价模型吸收，而应由第三章的包材与运输保障机制吸收（见 <a href=\"../tradein-collect-logistics/tradein-pickup-pack-kit\">旧品上门取件与寄回包材</a>）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"自述偏差是系统性的\">自述偏差是系统性的</h3><p>一个反直觉的经验事实是：用户自述偏差不是零均值噪声，而是<strong>方向性</strong>的。用户倾向于把成色报得比实际好，因为报价直接与成色挂钩。这意味着：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mtext>true</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>自述状态优于实际</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{E}[\\hat{x} - x_{\\text{true}}] &lt; 0 \\quad (\\text{自述状态优于实际})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">true</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">自述状态优于实际</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>所以「用点估计做报价」会让平台系统性高估残值，最终在到检环节集体下调，产生大规模的用户不满。正确做法是在报价阶段就<strong>预先施加一个保守偏置</strong>，即按自述特征对应的实检分布的下分位数定价，而不是按均值定价。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import math&#10;&#10;def biased_quote(base_price, feature_snapshot, feature_stats):&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;按实检价分布的下分位定价，抵消自述的系统性乐观偏差。&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    factor = 1.0&#10;    for key, value in feature_snapshot.items():&#10;        stat = feature_stats[key][value]&#10;        # stat: {&quot;mean_factor&quot;: 0.94, &quot;p25_factor&quot;: 0.88, &quot;n&quot;: 1200}&#10;        shrink = stat[&quot;n&quot;] / (stat[&quot;n&quot;] + 200.0)   # 小样本向均值收缩&#10;        factor *= shrink * stat[&quot;p25_factor&quot;] + (1 - shrink) * stat[&quot;mean_factor&quot;]&#10;    return math.floor(base_price * factor)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> math</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> biased_quote</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(base_price, feature_snapshot, feature_stats):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"按实检价分布的下分位定价，抵消自述的系统性乐观偏差。\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    factor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> key, value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> feature_snapshot.items():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        stat </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> feature_stats[key][value]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # stat: {\"mean_factor\": 0.94, \"p25_factor\": 0.88, \"n\": 1200}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        shrink </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stat[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"n\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (stat[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"n\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 200.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 小样本向均值收缩</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        factor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shrink </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stat[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"p25_factor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shrink) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stat[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"mean_factor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> math.floor(base_price </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> factor)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这里有两个工程决策值得展开。<strong>分位数选择</strong>：用 p25 而不是 p10 或 p50，因为太保守会让报价缺乏竞争力、太激进则必然引发下调。p25 把「四分之三的交易不会被下调」作为一个可测量的目标，这个目标可以直接从运营指标反推。<strong>小样本收缩</strong>：新上市的型号缺少实检样本，直接使用单型号统计会产生极端值，用 <code>n/(n+200)</code> 向全局均值收缩，让样本量决定信任度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"报价区间的构造\">报价区间的构造</h2><p>区间不能凭感觉给，它必须能被解释成一个概率陈述：「实检价落在区间内的概率约为 80%」。构造方式有三种，按可用数据量选择。</p>\n<p>第一种是<strong>经验分位法</strong>：直接从同型号同特征的历史（自述 → 实检价）配对中取 p10 与 p50。它最准，但要求样本量足够。第二种是<strong>误差模型法</strong>：对 <code>实检价 / 报价点值</code> 的比值分布拟合一个参数化分布（如对数正态），用分布的分位数给区间。它适用于样本中等的情况。第三种是<strong>分层回退法</strong>：样本不足以分层时，用品类级误差分布替代，并在区间宽度上增加一个惩罚项，让数据不足的报价区间自动更宽。三者级联的顺序是固定的。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>width</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>quote</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>category</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>model</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>k</mi><msqrt><mi>n</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{width}(\\text{quote}) = w_{\\text{base}}(\\text{category}, \\text{model}) \\times \\left(1 + \\frac{k}{\\sqrt{n}}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">width</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">quote</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">category</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">model</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3097em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8003em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2397em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.93em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>右侧的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mi>n</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k/\\sqrt{n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8003em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2397em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 项是样本量惩罚：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 越小，区间越宽，报价越「不确定」，这与用户直觉一致，也让报价平台在冷门型号上自动变得更保守。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;quote_price_cents&quot;: 33106,&#10;  &quot;quote_range&quot;: { &quot;low_cents&quot;: 27500, &quot;high_cents&quot;: 35200, &quot;coverage&quot;: 0.8 },&#10;  &quot;confidence_basis&quot;: &quot;empirical_p10_p50&quot;,&#10;  &quot;sample_n&quot;: 1840,&#10;  &quot;expectation_notice&quot;: &quot;到检后按实检成色调整，约 75% 的订单不会下调&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"quote_price_cents\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">33106</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"quote_range\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"low_cents\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">27500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"high_cents\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">35200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"coverage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"confidence_basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"empirical_p10_p50\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"sample_n\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1840</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"expectation_notice\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"到检后按实检成色调整，约 75% 的订单不会下调\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>expectation_notice</code> 是产品层的关键字段：区间的下界必须以自然语言出现在用户可见的报价页上，否则「区间」在用户心里等于不存在，到检下调仍然是一次意外。把「约 75% 的订单不会下调」这句话讲清楚，能把投诉集中度从「为什么又调价」转移到「我的机器确实有问题」。</p>\n<h3 id=\"置信度的门控\">置信度的门控</h3><p>置信度不只是展示给用户的，它也应当成为一个<strong>过程门控</strong>。低置信度的报价不应该被自动接受为大额抵扣，因为它对应更高的下调风险，也对应更高的争议概率。可落地的规则是：当区间宽度超过点值的某个比例（例如 35%）时，把该报价标记为「需人工复核」，或者限制其在单笔订单中的抵扣上限。这个门控把估价模型的不确定性直接接到了第二章的额度设计上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"到检调整规则\">到检调整规则</h2><p>到检调整是置信度机制的执行端。它的设计原则只有一条：<strong>调整必须由特征级差异驱动，而不是由一个总额差额驱动</strong>。给用户看「您的报价下调了 300 元」是无法辩护的；给用户看「屏幕实检为轻微划痕（自述完好），扣减 180 元；电池实检 78%（自述正常），扣减 120 元」才是可辩护的。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def regrade(quote, inspection):&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;按特征级差异计算到检价，并回传可解释的差异明细。&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    factor = 1.0&#10;    deltas = []&#10;    for key, weights in FEATURE_WEIGHTS.items():&#10;        declared = quote[&quot;feature_snapshot&quot;][key]&#10;        actual = inspection[key]&#10;        if declared == actual:&#10;            continue&#10;        d = weights[actual] - weights[declared]&#10;        if d &gt; 0:&#10;            deltas.append({&quot;feature&quot;: key, &quot;declared&quot;: declared,&#10;                           &quot;actual&quot;: actual, &quot;factor_delta&quot;: round(d, 4)})&#10;        factor -= d&#10;    real_price = math.floor(quote[&quot;base_price_cents&quot;] * max(factor, 0.0))&#10;    return {&quot;real_price_cents&quot;: real_price, &quot;deltas&quot;: deltas}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> regrade</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(quote, inspection):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"按特征级差异计算到检价，并回传可解释的差异明细。\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    factor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    deltas </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> key, weights </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> FEATURE_WEIGHTS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.items():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        declared </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quote[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"feature_snapshot\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">][key]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        actual </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inspection[key]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> declared </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> actual:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            continue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        d </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> weights[actual] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> weights[declared]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> d </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            deltas.append({</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"feature\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: key, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"declared\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: declared,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                           \"actual\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: actual, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"factor_delta\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(d, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        factor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    real_price </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> math.floor(quote[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"base_price_cents\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(factor, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"real_price_cents\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: real_price, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"deltas\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: deltas}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意这里有一个不对称设计：<strong>只累加「实检比自述差」的差异，不累加「实检比自述好」的差异</strong>。原因是报价已经按 p25 分位数预先保守，用户的合理预期是「只要描述属实就不会下调」，而不是「描述保守就能涨」。如果允许上浮，会激励用户故意低报成色来博取上浮，这是一个可被套利的机制。少数法域出于消费者保护要求双向调整，这时须把上浮做成显式的政策开关，并在报价页写明。</p>\n<p>主流厂商的换新流程印证了这个「差异触发重定价、用户可接受或拒绝」的形态：Apple 的换新条款写明，到货检验后若实际状态与描述不符，会向用户发送「修订后的价值」（a revised value），用户可以选择接受或拒绝（<a href=\"https://www.apple.com/shop/trade-in\">Apple Trade In</a>）。这个设计把最终的成交决定权留在用户手上，也让差异本身成为一个需要被解释的对象而不是既成事实。</p>\n<h3 id=\"复核与申诉通道\">复核与申诉通道</h3><p>任何自动调整都需要一条复核通道，否则验机台的判错就没有出口。可落地的最小设计是：用户对 <code>deltas</code> 中任一项提出异议 → 触发重新拍照复核 → 复核结果覆盖首次判定 → 若仍不一致则按平台兜底规则处理（通常是把该差异项按有利于用户的方向取值，并把成本计入运营损耗而不是用户账单）。复核的触发率本身是一个质量指标：它持续偏高说明验机标准在不同机构间不一致，那是验机标定问题而不是客服问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"置信度与交易链的接口\">置信度与交易链的接口</h2><p>置信度的输出在两个地方被消费。向下游，它决定到检调整的规则参数（低置信度报价适用更宽松的调整阈值，见 <a href=\"../tradein-collect-logistics/inspect-grade-regrade\">到检验机与重新定级</a>）。向上游，它决定报价的有效期与锁价范围——一个宽区间的报价不应该被长时间锁定，因为它对应的风险敞口更大（见 <a href=\"quote-validity-price-lock\">报价有效期与价格锁定</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  Q[报价: 点值 + 区间宽度] --&gt; C{区间宽度 &gt; 阈值?}&#10;  C --&gt;|是| G1[标记需复核&lt;br/&gt;限制抵扣上限]&#10;  C --&gt;|否| G2[正常进入订单]&#10;  G1 --&gt; O[订单抵扣额度]&#10;  G2 --&gt; O&#10;  Q --&gt; V[锁价时长&lt;br/&gt;宽区间 -&gt; 短锁价]&#10;  V --&gt; O\">graph TD\n  Q[报价: 点值 + 区间宽度] --&gt; C{区间宽度 &gt; 阈值?}\n  C --&gt;|是| G1[标记需复核&lt;br/&gt;限制抵扣上限]\n  C --&gt;|否| G2[正常进入订单]\n  G1 --&gt; O[订单抵扣额度]\n  G2 --&gt; O\n  Q --&gt; V[锁价时长&lt;br/&gt;宽区间 -&gt; 短锁价]\n  V --&gt; O</pre><p>这张图的工程含义是：置信度不是一个展示字段，而是一个在交易链上产生真实分支的输入。把区间宽度做成可查询的字段（而不是只在报价页渲染一次），订单服务与锁价服务才能读它。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>估价误差分四类：自述偏差与验机差异可建模，基准价滞后只能打时间戳，运输随机损伤应转移给保障机制。</li>\n<li>自述偏差是<strong>方向性</strong>的（用户系统性乐观），所以报价应按实检分布的下分位而非均值定价。</li>\n<li>区间有无经验分位、误差模型、分层回退三种构造方式，按样本量级联；样本量惩罚项让冷门型号自动更宽。</li>\n<li>用户可见的报价页必须出现区间的自然语言表述，否则区间在体验上不存在。</li>\n<li>到检调整必须特征级驱动且<strong>只向下调整</strong>，上浮会形成低报套利；自动调整必须配一条复核通道。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"估价置信度与到检调整","id":"估价置信度与到检调整"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：不确定性从哪来","id":"核心概念-不确定性从哪来"},{"level":3,"text":"自述偏差是系统性的","id":"自述偏差是系统性的"},{"level":2,"text":"报价区间的构造","id":"报价区间的构造"},{"level":3,"text":"置信度的门控","id":"置信度的门控"},{"level":2,"text":"到检调整规则","id":"到检调整规则"},{"level":3,"text":"复核与申诉通道","id":"复核与申诉通道"},{"level":2,"text":"置信度与交易链的接口","id":"置信度与交易链的接口"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"成色与市场残值估价模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-in-exchange-program/used-tradein-valuation/condition-market-residual-value"},"next":{"title":"报价有效期与价格锁定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-in-exchange-program/used-tradein-valuation/quote-validity-price-lock"}}